    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cock Fight Simulator is an innovative multiplayer fighting game that blends action and humor, set in a 3D third-person perspective where you control chickens and cocks battling it out in dynamic arenas. Currently developed by 4 university students, our game offers an engaging 1vs1 mode across three beautifully designed maps, with six unique weapons that offer a variety of ranged and melee combat styles. Each weapon has its own distinct characteristics, providing players with multiple tactical options during matches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We'd really love to recieve feedback about\u00a0bugs to solve and new ideas to implement in the game (also, a nice and active player base is a requirement to include a matchmaking system). Right now, we plan on expanding the multiplayer mode to allow more diverse lobbies, add new weapons, maps and  more customization for the roosters.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cock Fight Simulator is an innovative multiplayer fighting game that blends action and humor, set in a 3D third-person perspective where you control chickens and cocks battling it out in dynamic arenas. Currently developed by 4 university students, our game offers an engaging 1vs1 mode across three beautifully designed maps, with six unique weapons that offer a variety of ranged and melee combat styles. Each weapon has its own distinct characteristics, providing players with multiple tactical options during matches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We'd really love to recieve feedback about\u00a0bugs to solve and new ideas to implement in the game (also, a nice and active player base is a requirement to include a matchmaking system). Right now, we plan on expanding the multiplayer mode to allow more diverse lobbies, add new weapons, maps and  more customization for the roosters.</p>",
